    /**
     * Normalizes a URI path so that it always starts with a single leading slash.
     * <p>
     * The original implementation only removed leading slashes but never added one
     * back if the input was missing it, which could cause the path to be parsed
     * incorrectly as a host or other URI component.  The new implementation
