/**
 * DefaultURLConstructor provides a safe implementation of {@link URLConstructor#getForwardPage(HttpServletRequest)}.
 * <p>
 * The original implementation returned {@code request.getPathInfo()} directly, which exposed the application to
 * path‑traversal attacks.  The new implementation validates and sanitises the path before returning it,
 * falling back to a safe default when the input is invalid or potentially dangerous.
