public class Expander {

    // other methods

    /**
     * Extracts entries supplied by {@code supplier} into {@code targetDirectory}.
     *
     * <p>This method performs rigorous path validation to prevent path‑traversal attacks.
     * It rejects absolute paths, normalizes relative paths, and ensures that the resolved
     * destination always resides within {@code targetDirectory}. Directory creation and
     * file writing are performed using the NIO API for atomicity and better error handling.</p>
